# Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6 - Epic Rage Feats
# Table 5-11 and pages 94-96

Arctic Rage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PRESTAT:1,CON=25	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.PrimalRage	DESC:Spend 3 rounds of rage per round to gain benefits of ice body while raging.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.94
Bear's Rage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.MightyRage	DESC:Morale bonus to Constitution from rage increases by +2.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.94
Bull's Rage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.MightyRage	DESC:Morale bonus to Strength from rage increases by +2.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.94
Cat's Rage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.MightyRage	DESC:Gain +4 morale bonus to Dexterity while raging. Additional selections grant +2 each.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.94
Chaotic Rage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.PrimalRage	DESC:Weapons treated as chaotic power while raging.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Cursebreaker Rage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.PrimalRage	DESC:Spend 2 rounds of rage per round to gain SR equal to 10 + level in rage-granting class.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Enduring Vitality	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.RagingVitality	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.MightyRage	DESC:When dropping out of rage, if HP would render you unconscious or dead, reduced to 1 HP instead.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Gentle Fury	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.MightyRage	DESC:Double Strength bonus to damage when inflicting nonlethal damage while raging.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Guillotine Grapple	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PRESTAT:1,STR=31	PREABILITY:3,CATEGORY=FEAT,Deadly Grappler,Unfair Grip,Bloody Fist	DESC:When grappled, force Fort save (DC 10+1/2 level+Str) or be decapitated.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Immaculate Rage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.InternalFortitude	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.FearlessRage	DESC:Immune to Dazed, Stunned, and Paralyzed while raging.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Perfect Rage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Immaculate Rage	DESC:Roll twice on Fort/Will saves while raging and take the higher result.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.96
Incandescent Rage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PRESTAT:1,CON=29	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Obdurate Rage	DESC:Spend 3 rounds per round to gain benefits of fiery body while raging.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Incite Rage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PRESTAT:1,CHA=25	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.MightyRage	DESC:Incite rage in willing allies within 60 ft. Allies gain +4 Str, +4 Con, +2 Will, -2 AC. Duration: 3+Con mod rounds.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Mad Movement	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PREABILITY:3,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.RagingClimber,TYPE.RagingLeaper,TYPE.RagingSwimmer	DESC:Movement +20 ft while raging. Ignore non-magical difficult terrain. 5x speed when running.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.96
Mighty Surge	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.StrengthSurge	DESC:Strength Surge bonus equals twice your level in the class that grants rage.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.96
Monstrous Rage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.GreaterAnimalFury	DESC:Natural attacks while raging deal damage as one size larger. Threat range +1, crit multiplier +1, attacks are epic.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.96
Mountain Hurler	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PRESTAT:1,STR=29	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.GreaterHurling	DESC:Range increment +60 ft or increase hurled object size by 4 categories.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.96
Obdurate Rage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PRESTAT:1,CON=27	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Arctic Rage	DESC:Spend 3 rounds per round to gain benefits of iron body while raging.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.96
Primal Rage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PRESTAT:2,STR=21,CON=21	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.MightyRage	DESC:While raging: DR from class levels doubles, Str bonus to damage x1.5.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.96
Ruinous Rage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PRESTAT:1,STR=25	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.ImprovedSunder	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.MightyRage	DESC:While raging, ignore object hardness. Double Str bonus for breaking objects.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.96
Shattering Strike	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.PowerfulBlow	DESC:Powerful Blow bonus equals twice your level in the class that grants rage.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.96
Terrifying Rage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PRESKILL:1,Intimidate=21	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.MightyRage	DESC:While raging, enemies must Will save or become panicked (HD < level) or shaken (HD >= level) for 4d6 rounds.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.96
Thundering Rage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PRESTAT:1,STR=25	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.PrimalRage	DESC:Weapons treated as sonic blast while raging. Crit hits: Fort save or go deaf.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.96
Towering Rage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PRESTAT:1,STR=27	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.PrimalRage	DESC:Spend 2 rounds per round to gain benefits of giant form I while raging.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.96
Titan Rage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Rage	PRESTAT:1,STR=29	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Towering Rage	DESC:Spend 3 rounds per round to gain benefits of giant form II while raging.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.96
